{"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/cardmoduleguide"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Card (Low-Level)"},"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module provides low-level cryptographic services for sensitive card operations. Unlike ","type":"text"},{"code":"CardSessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (which handles networking, session management, and token handling automatically), the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"text":" module is a pure crypto library: you manage all network calls yourself and use the SDK only for encryption and decryption.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"code":"Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" module when you need:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Full control over the network layer (custom networking stack, interceptors, retry logic)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Integration into an architecture that doesn’t use ","type":"text"},{"code":"async\/await","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Direct access to the encrypted keys and data for custom backend flows"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"name":"Tip","type":"aside","style":"tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you prefer a higher-level API that handles networking and token management, use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" instead.","type":"text"}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Import","text":"Import","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Card"],"type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module is a standalone cryptographic library that can be used without the rest of the SDK.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Session Token Roles","anchor":"Session-Token-Roles"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend needs the following API credential roles to call the Adyen endpoints used in these flows:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Operation","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Role"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card reveal"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bank Issuing PaymentInstrument Reveal Webservice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN reveal"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bank Issuing Pin Reveal Webservice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN change","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bank Issuing Pin Change Webservice"}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Card-Reveal","type":"heading","text":"Card Reveal"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reveal the card’s PAN, CVC, and expiry date.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Flow","level":3,"anchor":"Flow","type":"heading"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen ("},{"code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=panReveal&format=jwk","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the public key to the SDK to generate an encrypted session key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend sends the encrypted key to Adyen ("},{"code":"POST \/paymentInstruments\/reveal","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") and receives encrypted card data"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the encrypted data to the SDK to decrypt and obtain the card details"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Implementation","level":3,"anchor":"Implementation"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let cardRevealService = CardRevealService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate an encrypted key using the public key from your backend.","\/\/    The public key is the raw JWK data from the Adyen \/publicKey endpoint.","\/\/    The service retains the generated symmetric key for the decryption step.","let encryptedKey = try cardRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    jwk: publicKeyData",")","","\/\/ 3. Send `encryptedKey` to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/paymentInstruments\/reveal with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedKey","\/\/    }","\/\/    and returns the `encryptedData` string from the response.","","\/\/ 4. Decrypt the card details using the same service instance","let details = try cardRevealService.cardDetails(","    encryptedData: encryptedData",")","","\/\/ Access the decrypted values","details.pan            \/\/ Full PAN, e.g. \"5412345678901234\"","details.cvc            \/\/ CVC, e.g. \"123\"","details.expiration.month  \/\/ e.g. \"03\"","details.expiration.year   \/\/ e.g. \"2028\""]},{"name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on the same "},{"code":"CardRevealService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance that produced the encrypted key. The instance retains the symmetric key generated by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"},{"text":"; calling ","type":"text"},{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before generating a key throws "},{"code":".keyNotGenerated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"important"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have a PEM\/DER-encoded public key instead of JWK, use "},{"code":"generateEncryptedKey(pem:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"code":["let encryptedKey = try cardRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    pem: derEncodedPublicKey",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Error-Handling","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Error Handling"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"generateEncryptedKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardDetails"},{"type":"text","text":" throw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardRevealService.CardRevealError"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Error","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidPublicKey","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The public key could not be parsed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".encryptionFailed"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key encryption failed","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".keyNotGenerated"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" was called before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidEncryptedData","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The encrypted data string is not valid hex"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".decryptionFailed","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AES decryption of the card data failed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".unexpectedData","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decryption succeeded but the payload could not be decoded","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"PIN Reveal","anchor":"PIN-Reveal"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrieve the card’s current PIN.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Flow","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Flow"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=pinReveal&format=jwk"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the public key to the SDK to generate an encrypted session key","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend sends the encrypted key to Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/pins\/reveal","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") and receives an encrypted PIN block and token"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass both to the SDK to decrypt and obtain the PIN","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Implementation","type":"heading","text":"Implementation"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let pinRevealService = PinRevealService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate an encrypted key.","\/\/    The service retains the generated symmetric key for the decryption step.","let encryptedKey = try pinRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    jwk: publicKeyData",")","","\/\/ 3. Send `encryptedKey` to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/pins\/reveal with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedKey","\/\/    }","\/\/    and returns `encryptedPinBlock` and `token` from the response.","","\/\/ 4. Decrypt the PIN using the same service instance","let pin = try pinRevealService.pin(","    encryptedPinBlock: encryptedPinBlock,","    token: token",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Error-Handling","type":"heading","text":"Error Handling"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"pin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" throw ","type":"text"},{"code":"PinRevealService.PinRevealError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Error","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cause","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidPublicKey","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The public key could not be parsed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".encryptionFailed"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key encryption failed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".keyNotGenerated"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pin"},{"type":"text","text":" was called before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidEncryptedData","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The encrypted PIN block is not valid"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".decryptionFailed"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decryption failed","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unexpectedData"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decrypted PIN block has an unexpected format"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"text":"PIN Change","anchor":"PIN-Change","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set a new PIN for the card.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Flow","anchor":"Flow","type":"heading","level":3},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=pinChange&format=jwk","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the public key and the new PIN to the SDK to generate the encrypted payload"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend sends the payload to Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/pins\/change","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"anchor":"Implementation","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Implementation"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let pinChangeService = PinChangeService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate the encrypted PIN block","let encryptedPin = try pinChangeService.encryptedPinBlock(","    jwk: publicKeyData,","    pin: newPin",")","","\/\/ 3. Send to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/pins\/change with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedPin.encryptedKey,","\/\/        \"encryptedPinBlock\": encryptedPin.encryptedPinBlock,","\/\/        \"token\": encryptedPin.token","\/\/    }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have a PEM\/DER-encoded public key:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let encryptedPin = try pinChangeService.encryptedPinBlock(","    pem: derEncodedPublicKey,","    pin: newPin",")"]},{"text":"Error Handling","anchor":"Error-Handling","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encryptedPinBlock"},{"text":" throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"PinChangeService.PinChangeError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Error","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPin"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PIN is malformed (non-decimal characters, too long)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unallowedPin"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The PIN is not permitted (sequential like ","type":"text"},{"code":"1234","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", repeated like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1111"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidPublicKey","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The public key could not be parsed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".encryptionFailed","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN encryption failed"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"text":"Security Considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Security-Considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module performs all cryptographic operations in memory. No sensitive data is written to disk.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The symmetric key generated during a reveal flow is ephemeral, held only for the lifetime of the service instance, and is never persisted or transmitted."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Display sensitive data (PAN, PIN) only temporarily and clear it from the UI promptly."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Never log or persist decrypted card details or PINs.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a fresh ","type":"text"},{"code":"CardRevealService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PinRevealService"},{"text":" instance per reveal operation, and generate a new encrypted key for each flow.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Migration-from-adyen-card-reveal-ios","text":"Migration from adyen-card-reveal-ios","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you previously used the standalone "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" package, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"text":" module is a drop-in replacement. The public API is unchanged; only the import name differs:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Old API","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"New API"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import AdyenCardReveal"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"import Card","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey(jwk:)"},{"type":"text","text":" → "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unchanged"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"cardDetails(encryptedData:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"unchanged","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pin(encryptedPinBlock:, token:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unchanged"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"encryptedPinBlock(pem:, pin:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unchanged"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replace "},{"code":"import AdyenCardReveal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; no other code changes are required."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reveal card details, reveal PINs, and change PINs using direct service calls."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardModuleGuide"},"references":{"doc://com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs/documentation/IssuingSDKDocs":{"title":"IssuingSDKDocs","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs"},"doc://com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs/documentation/IssuingSDKDocs/CardSessionsGuide":{"title":"Card Sessions","type":"topic","role":"article","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Securely reveal card details, reveal PINs, and change PINs.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide","url":"\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/cardsessionsguide"},"https://github.com/Adyen/adyen-card-reveal-ios":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios","title":"adyen-card-reveal-ios","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"adyen-card-reveal-ios"}]}}}